cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Please cite the original NCM paper for the model. For this independent
  Apple Silicon port, also identify the software version and source commit.
type: software
title: 'NCM Mac: reproducible Sudoku inference on Apple Silicon'
authors:
  - name: NCM Mac contributors
version: 0.2.0
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Independent CPU FP32 port of the official NCM Sudoku checkpoints, with
  prefix caching, intermediate-state repair, optional batch multiprocessing,
  exact-parity checks and exploratory Metal benchmarks. No model retraining.
preferred-citation:
